<title>ITALY: Italy Oct industrial orders down 2.2 pct yr-yr.</title>
<headline>Italy Oct industrial orders down 2.2 pct yr-yr.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian industrial orders fell 2.2 percent year-on-year in November while turnover rose 1.2 percent, national statistics institute Istat said.</p>
</text>
